<view class="container">
  <view class="card muted">
    对应设计稿「首页-我的记录04」画板。报警/出库/入库记录读的是真实设备数据（先选设备再跳转）；
    交班记录、库存记录设备协议里没有对应的上行数据，云端也没有接口，见 docs/miniprogram-design-gaps.md。
  </view>

  <view class="card" style="padding:0 24rpx;">
    <view
      wx:for="{{items}}"
      wx:key="title"
      class="list-row"
      bindtap="onItemTap"
      data-index="{{index}}"
    >
      <image class="list-row-icon-plain" src="/assets/icons/{{item.icon}}.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      <view class="list-row-body">
        <text>{{item.title}}</text>
        <view class="muted" wx:if="{{item.reason}}" style="margin-top:4rpx;">{{item.reason}}</view>
      </view>
      <image class="list-row-chevron" src="/assets/icons/chevron-right.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
